    "items": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Cantar de los cantares de Salomón."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Primer Canto"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "La amada"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ah, si me besaras con los besos de tu boca…",
          "¡grato en verdad es tu amor, más que el vino!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Grata es también de tus perfumes la fragancia;",
          "tú mismo eres bálsamo fragante.",
          "¡Con razón te aman las doncellas!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¡Hazme del todo tuya! ¡Date prisa!",
          "¡Llévame, oh rey, a tu alcoba!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Los amigos"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Regocijémonos y deleitémonos juntos,",
          "celebraremos tus caricias más que el vino.",
          "¡Sobran las razones para amarte!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "La amada"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Morena soy, pero hermosa,",
          "hijas de Jerusalén;",
          "morena como las tiendas de Cedar,",
          "hermosa como los tapices de Salmá."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "No os fijéis en mi tez morena,",
          "ni en que el sol me bronceó la piel.",
          "Mis hermanos se enfadaron contra mí,",
          "y me obligaron a cuidar las viñas;",
          "¡y mi propia viña descuidé!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Cuéntame, amor de mi vida,",
          "¿dónde apacientas tus rebaños?,",
          "¿dónde a la hora de la siesta los haces reposar?",
          "¿Por qué he de andar vagando",
          "entre los rebaños de tus amigos?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Los amigos"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Si no lo sabes, bella entre las bellas,",
          "ve tras la huella del rebaño",
          "y apacienta a tus cabritos",
          "junto a las moradas de los pastores."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "El amado"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Tú y tus adornos, amada mía,",
          "me recordáis a las yeguas enjaezadas",
          "de los carros del faraón."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¡Qué hermosas lucen tus mejillas entre los pendientes!",
          "¡Qué hermoso luce tu cuello entre los collares!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¡Haremos para ti pendientes de oro",
          "con incrustaciones de plata!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "La amada"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Mientras el rey se halla sentado a la mesa,",
          "mi perfume esparce su fragancia."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Mi amado es para mí como el saquito de mirra",
          "que duerme entre mis pechos."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Mi amado es para mí como un ramito de azahar",
          "de las viñas de Engadi."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "El amado"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¡Cuán bella eres, amada mía!",
          "¡Cuán bella eres!",
          "¡Tus ojos son dos palomas!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "La amada"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¡Cuán hermoso eres, amado mío!",
          "¡Eres un encanto!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "El amado"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Una alfombra de verdor es nuestro lecho,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "los cedros son las vigas de la casa",
          "y nos cubre un techo de cipreses."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
